---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 | 曦清农业" description="你访问的页面不存在。" noindex>
	<main class="not-found shell">
		<p class="eyebrow">ERROR / 404</p><h1>记录未找到</h1><p>这条实验记录可能尚未创建，或路径已经变更。</p>
		<a class="button button--dark" href="/">返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
